{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-sleep-study-schedule","revision":1,"title_en":"From ZZZs to AAAs: Why Sleep Is an Important Part of Your Study Schedule","title_zh":"从呼呼大睡到成绩全A：为什么睡眠是学习计划的重要部分","level":"B1","primary_topic":"school","tags":["science","learning","health"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":false,"summary_zh":"许多学生误以为熬夜复习更有效，但科学研究表明睡眠是记忆巩固不可或缺的环节。脑电研究揭示了浅睡期睡眠纺锤波与深睡期慢波在大脑重塑中的作用。科学家提出了快学习系统（海马体）与慢学习系统（大脑皮层）模型，指出深睡与午休有助于将白天的短暂记忆转化为长期知识。健康指南建议13至18岁青少年每晚保持8至10小时规律睡眠。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-21T12:55:31Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"Many students believe that staying up late to study is the best way to prepare for an exam.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"许多学生认为，熬夜复习是备考的最佳方式。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":4,"surface":"Many","lemma":"many","pos":"限定词","gloss_zh":"许多"},{"start":5,"end":13,"surface":"students","lemma":"student","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"学生"},{"start":14,"end":21,"surface":"believe","lemma":"believe","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"认为"},{"start":22,"end":26,"surface":"that","lemma":"that","pos":"从属连词","gloss_zh":"（引出宾语从句）"},{"start":27,"end":34,"surface":"staying","lemma":"stay","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"保持；停留"},{"start":35,"end":37,"surface":"up","lemma":"up","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"醒着；不睡"},{"start":38,"end":42,"surface":"late","lemma":"late","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"很晚"},{"start":43,"end":45,"surface":"to","lemma":"to","pos":"不定式标记","gloss_zh":"为了"},{"start":46,"end":51,"surface":"study","lemma":"study","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"学习；复习"},{"start":52,"end":54,"surface":"is","lemma":"be","pos":"系动词","gloss_zh":"是"},{"start":55,"end":58,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"定冠词","gloss_zh":"这"},{"start":59,"end":63,"surface":"best","lemma":"good","pos":"形容词最高级","gloss_zh":"最好的"},{"start":64,"end":67,"surface":"way","lemma":"way","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"方法；途径"},{"start":68,"end":70,"surface":"to","lemma":"to","pos":"不定式标记","gloss_zh":"（引出后置定语）"},{"start":71,"end":78,"surface":"prepare","lemma":"prepare","pos":"动词","glos